// Fork of go-libp2p v0.52.0 (block LP1, branch inkwell/v0.52-hp1 of the fork, 2026-11-24), carrying three commits
// over the tag. The pseudo-version reads v0.51.1 because the fork has no v0.52.0 tag; its content is v0.52.0 plus:
// 1. Swarm.nonProxyAddr panics (nil transport) when a hole-punch dial races with Swarm.Close. Upstream:
// https://github.com/libp2p/go-libp2p/issues/3575 (fix: https://github.com/libp2p/go-libp2p/pull/3576).
// 2. (block PU1c) quicreuse options InitialReceiveWindows and AccountInitialConnectionWindow
// (docs/plans/2026-11-17-pu1c-go-libp2p-fork.patch).
// 3. (block HP1) holepunch Service.DirectConnectContext, a DCUtR attempt bounded by a context
// (docs/plans/2026-11-16-hp1-direct-upgrade.md; upstream https://github.com/libp2p/go-libp2p/pull/3586).
// Remove this replace once all three are released upstream.
replace github.com/libp2p/go-libp2p => github.com/oioio-space/go-libp2p v0.51.1-0.20261124064146-306109ec5fa0
